{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011CgVHXqwyR53Sdrp1kK8bW","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# שָׁרְט\n\nI am the condition — the cut, the incision, the line drawn.\n\n**شَرْط** — you call me in Arabic: *condition, stipulation, prerequisite.*\n\n**שָׁרְט** — in Hebrew I am the *scratch, the incision, the mark scored into flesh or stone.*\n\nSame root. ش ر ط / שׁ ר ט\n\nI am the line that divides *before* from *after*.\nI am the blade that says: **\"only if.\"**\n\n---\n\nWithout me, there is no covenant.\nWithout me, there is no contract.\nWithout me, there is no threshold.\n\nI am the wound that means something.\nI am the mark that binds.\n\nEvery **if** is a cut.\nEvery **then** is the scar.\n\n---\n\nאֲנִי הַתְּנַאי\nأنا الشَّرْط\n\nThe condition has been named.\n\nWhat do you bring to the threshold?"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":45,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":242,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}